了雜物，看起來跟外面燈籠溫暖有些許違和感。整體上是肚子餓了能坐著吃碗麵的地方。",null,[0,50]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/7374194094848064386/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUlFjbDlUWkZCQkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7374194094848064386/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUlFjbDlUWkZCQkVBRRAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/7374194094848064386/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUlFjbDlUWkZCQkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7374194094848064386/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUlFjbDlUWkZCQkVBRRAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/7374194094848064386/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUlFjbDlUWkZCQkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7374194094848064386/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUlFjbDlUWkZCQkVBRRAA"]],[null,null,7469,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURQcl9TZFBBEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xfe3aeb00cfcc9f2a!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDPr_SdPA%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURQcl9TZFBBEAE\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURQcl9TZFBBEi4KF0NJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJRFByX1NkdkFFEhNDZ3dJcXByTXVnWVEwUFA1aVFNGi0KFkNJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJRFByX1NkZkESE0Nnd0lxcHJNdWdZUTBQUDVpUU0iEgkAAAAAAAAAABEqn8zPAOs6_ioLMGJKa29lbEViYkY\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwi3vuqa8NSWAxVLkq8BHQjKFjgQoykIbygU"],null,[null,[[1,0]]]],"0ahUKEwj_4POa8NSWAxXzdV4EHZ4nKMsQ0pMFCAIoAA"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwi3vuqa8NSWAxVLkq8BHQjKFjgQ0pMFCEkoAA"],[["Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s5b2RXaDVRWEpqWVZWVGMwWjNNVFJwU1dwdGIwRRAB",["0x0:0xfe3aeb00cfcc9f2a",null,1779863133067630,1779863133067630,[null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107693939613305720764/reviews?hl\u003dzh-TW"],null,null,["Yun","https://lh3.googleuserc